<dialog id="scanDialog"><div class="dialog-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">FROM PAPER TO PLAYABLE</div><h2>Scan a melody</h2></div><button id="scanClose" aria-label="Close scanner">✕</button></div><p>Start with a sharp scan of a single melody. Slight tilt and uneven lighting are corrected automatically. Piano scores, handwriting, rests, accidentals, and ornaments need manual correction. Set the printed key and meter below.</p><div class="scan-upload"><button id="chooseScan" class="button primary">Choose photo or PDF</button><button id="sampleScan" class="button light">Try a sample scan</button></div><div id="scanPreview" hidden><div class="scan-image-wrap"><canvas id="scanCanvas"></canvas></div><div class="scan-tools"><button id="rotateLeft">Rotate −1°</button><button id="rotateRight">Rotate +1°</button><label id="pdfPageLabel" hidden>PDF page <select id="pdfPage"></select></label></div><div class="three">${select('scanClef','Printed clef',[['treble','Treble'],['alto','Alto']],'treble')}${select('scanKey','Printed key signature',M.keyNames.map((k,i)=>[M.fifthValues[i],k+' major / relative modes']),2)}${select('scanMeter','Time signature',[['4/4','4/4'],['3/4','3/4'],['2/4','2/4'],['6/8','6/8'],['9/8','9/8'],['12/8','12/8']],'6/8')}</div><div class="two scan-context-controls">${select('scanInterpretation','Unclear pitches',[['context','Favor musical context'],['visual','Use visual reading only']],'context')}${select('scanMode','Tune mode',[['major','Major'],['minor','Natural minor'],['dorian','Dorian'],['mixolydian','Mixolydian']],'major')}</div><p class="hint">Context uses the printed key, mode, nearby notes, and repeated phrases. Confident readings stay unchanged. Suggested changes stay amber and can be reversed in the workshop.</p><div class="scan-warning">Experimental draft: noteheads use an Oemer recognition model; Voilà! estimates pitches, barlines, and rhythms. Key/clef changes, rests, ties, repeats, and printed accidentals are not recognized reliably. Uncertain noteheads are marked amber in the workshop; rhythm mismatches are flagged. Check every measure.</div><button id="runScan" class="button primary">Recognize this page</button><button id="cancelScan" class="button light" hidden>Cancel</button></div><p id="scanProgress" role="status"></p><p class="hint">Scanning runs on your device. The first scan loads a 38 MB model; a page may take a minute or more. PDF pages are scanned one at a time.</p></dialog>
